  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>곈<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>치<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qENyO32SVbc?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"thau-jiéng\">頭前<rt>ᄐᅷ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"lōr\">路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jāi\">知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby>長<rt>등ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby>邇<rt>니-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"khòr\">苦<rt>커ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thau-jiéng’e lōr m-jāi-roa-tńg roa-ni-khòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"khoà̰\">看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"kia̰\">行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>一步<rt>짇버ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"sǹg\">算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一步<rt>짇버ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-boe-tiôh kia̰-tioh-jit-pōr sǹg-jit-pōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"lôh\">落<rt>롷ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"î-kiēng\">已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>沃澹<rt>악ˆ담ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>衫褲<rt>살ˉ커</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hor-jùi na-lôh î-kiēng-âk-tám gûn-sā̰-khor\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jun\">陣<rt>준-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hông\">風<rt>헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jî\">只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"sîm\">心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>更加<rt>곙ˋ가ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>堅強<rt>곈ˉ경ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jît-jun-hông jî-si-hor-gùn’e sîm kièng-kā-kiēn-kióng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>成功<rt>솅겅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>背後<rt>붸효ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄-</rt></ruby><ruby>苦楚<rt>커ˆ처ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sieng-kông’e pue-hiō m-jāi-u-roa-joe-khôr-chòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"soân-tiêk\">選擇<rt>솬ˆ뎩ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"lōr\">路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"ît-tieng\">一定<rt>읻ˆ뎽-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"kiēn-chi\">堅持<rt>곈ˉ치-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"kàu\">到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"sieng-kông\">成功<rt>솅겅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gûn-soân-tiêk’e lōr ît-tieng-kiēn-chi-kàu-sieng-kông\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>堅定<rt>곈ˉ뎽ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"sîm\">心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>伴<rt>퐐-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>向前行<rt>형ˋ졘걀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"chiâ̰\">請<rt>챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"kì\">記<rt>기ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiēn-tiēng’e sîm phoa̰-gùn hiòng-jien-kiá̰ chiâ̰-lì e-kì-tioh-gùn’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"láng\">人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>出世<rt>춛ˆ시</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>好命<rt>호ˆ먀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"yong\">用<rt>영-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"miā\">命<rt>먀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"phâh-pia̰\">拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-láng chût-si tio-hô-miā gùn si-yong-miā lêh-phâh-pia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"kiā̰\">驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>失敗<rt>싣ˆ배</rt></ruby> <ruby>慢慢<rt>빤빤-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hiòng-jien-kiá̰\">向前行<rt>형ˋ졘걀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>運命<rt>운먀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"thḭ̄\">天<rt>틸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jù-tiā̰\">注定<rt>주ˋ댤ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kiā̰-sît-pai ban-ban-hiòng-jien-kiá̰ un-miā m-si-thḭ̄-jù-tiā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>只要<rt>지ˆᄋᆤˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>用心<rt>영심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"lai\">來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"phâh-pia̰\">拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"ît-tieng\">一定<rt>읻ˆ뎽-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"chiṵ̀\">唱<rt>츌ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"chût\">出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"miá\">名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jî-yàu-yong-sîm lai-phâh-pia̰ ît-tieng-chiṵ̀-chût-gùn’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"thau-jiéng\">頭前<rt>ᄐᅷ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"lōr\">路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jāi\">知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby>長<rt>등ˊ</rt></ruby> <